{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102987","id":2341569254,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6LkYLm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102987","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102987.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102987.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102987","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102987/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102987/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102987/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/eee3384e20cf8187b7a1ebd8746f5eb32de08290","number":102987,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[LinuxBSD] Add support for HDR output (Wayland)","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Description updated for 2026/02/23.\r\n\r\nBased on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/94496 (merged to master)\r\nImplements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10817 for Wayland\r\nTesting/Sample project: https://github.com/DarkKilauea/godot-hdr-output\r\n\r\nThis PR implements the luminance based features of the [wp-color-management](https://wayland.app/protocols/color-management-v1) protocol as well as the minimum amount of colorspace + transfer function features necessary for HDR output.\r\n\r\nDue to the unreliability of HDR applying glare compensation or not, SDR over HDR is assumed to be performed against a monitor which does not apply glare compensation which differs from the assumptions made in the Windows and Mac implementations for HDR. The Wayland protocol was made with this assumption so we will not deviate from it despite having the possibility to do so.\r\n\r\nSince this feature is exclusive to Wayland, the display server must be set to Wayland in both project settings and editor settings (not setting both to Wayland leads to inconsistencies in display server selection).\r\n\r\nFor editor: `run/platforms/linuxbsd/prefer_wayland` must be enabled.\r\nFor project: `display/display_server/driver.linuxbsd` set to \"wayland\" (X11 is still set chosen when \"deafault\" is selected).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"a